  "description": "An update to Component factory's krypton toolkit to support .NET Framework 4.6.2 - 4.8.1 and .NET 6 - 8. This is the core toolkit module. This package supports all .NET Framework versions starting .NET Framework 4.6.2 - 4.8.1 and .NET 6 - 7. Also, all libraries are included targeting each specific framework version for performance purposes. To view all of the standard toolkit package latest version information, please visit: https://github.com/Krypton-Suite/Krypton-Toolkit-Suite-Version-Dashboard/blob/main/Documents/Modules/Standard/Krypton-Toolkit-Suite-Standard-Modules.md",
